@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: UC03 - Logout

actor "User" as User
boundary "UserProfileDropdown" as Page
control "AuthController" as Controller
control "AuthService" as Service
entity "UserRepository" as Repository
database "Database" as Database

User -> Page : Click "Đăng xuất"
activate Page

Page -> Page : localStorage.clear()\n(Remove JWT Token)

Page -> User : Redirect to /login\n(Chuyển hướng trang đăng nhập)
deactivate Page

note over Controller, Database
  JWT is stateless. No backend API call is required for logout.
  Token invalidation is handled strictly on the client side.
end note

@enduml
